<title>USA: Nashville and Davidson, Tenn., GOS won by Wachovia.</title>
<headline>Nashville and Davidson, Tenn., GOS won by Wachovia.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wachovia Bank said it won $96.135 million Metropolitan Government of Nashville and Davidson County, Tenn., general obligation public improvement bonds Series 1996A at a true interest cost of 5.305 percent.</p>
</text>
